Musculoskeletal: Reports right knee pain, left knee pain, and left shoulder pain.
Respiratory: Denies shortness of breath.
Cardiovascular: Denies chest pain.
Gastrointestinal: Denies nausea, vomiting, and abdominal pain.
Endocrine: Reports high blood pressure and diabetes.

VITALS

