PMhx: none, 
SHx: no other medical problems, 
DHx: no relevant, 
PMhx: no relevant, 
FHx: no relevant, 
DHx: no relevant
Imp: Anterior Cruciate Ligament (ACL) tear, 
Plan: 
- MRI of the right knee
- Meloxicam 50mg PO QD for 2 weeks
- Ice application if necessary
- Limit activities
- Use crutches for ambulation
- No jogging for the time being
- Follow up with the doctor for the results of the MRI
- Consider surgery based on the results of the MRI
- Consider physical therapy for rehabilitation after surgery }}<|eot_id|>
